build/host_graph

# NOTE: prebuilt/ is intentionally tracked -- it holds the deliverable
# per-graph artifacts (baked kernel, U280 csynth report, packaged IP, golden
# expected.txt) AND the built .xclbin for each design, ~47 MiB apiece. They are
# committed deliberately so a run needs no Vitis install; see each directory's
# BUILD.md for sha256, platform VBNV and routed timing. Rebuild instructions
# are in LOAD_AND_TEST.md.

# python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
